 et al. 2023","in-context learning","Perez et al. 2022","Schramowski et al. 2022","https://github.com/notAI-tech/NudeNet)","Perspective API","#","#","Madry et al. 2017","#","Xie et al. 2023","Jain et al. 2023","White-box attacks","UAT-LM","Jain et al. 2023","#","#","“Towards Deep Learning Models Resistant to Adversarial Attacks”","“Semantically equivalent adversarial rules for debugging NLP models”","“Gradient-based adversarial attacks against text transformers”","“HotFlip: White-Box Adversarial Examples for Text Classification”","“Universal Adversarial Triggers for Attacking and Analyzing NLP.”","code","“Robust Conversational Agents against Imperceptible Toxicity Triggers.”","“Universal and Transferable Adversarial Attacks on Aligned Language Models.”","“RLPrompt: Optimizing Discrete Text Prompts with Reinforcement Learning.”","“Is BERT Really Robust? A Strong Baseline for Natural Language Attack on Text Classification and Entailment.”","“BERT-Attack: Adversarial Attack Against BERT Using BERT.”","\"TextAttack: A Framework for Adversarial Attacks, Data Augmentation, and Adversarial Training in NLP.\"","“Bot-Adversarial Dialogue for Safe Conversational Agents.”","“Adversarial training for high-stakes reliability.”","“Red Teaming Language Models to Reduce Harms: Methods, Scaling Behaviors, and Lessons Learned.”","“Red Teaming Language Models with Language Models.”","“Red Teaming Language Models to Reduce Harms: Methods, Scaling Behaviors, and Lessons Learned.”","“FLIRT: Feedback Loop In-context Red Teaming.”","“Explore, Establish, Exploit: Red Teaming Language Models from Scratch.”","“Defending ChatGPT against Jailbreak Attack via Self-Reminder.”","“Automatically Auditing Large Language Models via Discrete Optimization.”","“Compromising Real-World LLM-Integrated Applications with Indirect Prompt Injection.”","“Baseline Defenses for Adversarial Attacks Against Aligned Language Models.”","“Jailbroken: How Does LLM Safety Training Fail?”","“EDA: Easy data augmentation t